{"overview":"The tranquility of a small town is marred only by sheriff Tod Shaw's unsuccessful courtship of widow Ellen Benson, a pacifist who can't abide guns and those who use them. But violence descends on Ellen's household willy-nilly when the U.S. President passes through town... and slightly psycho hired assassin John Baron finds the Benson home ideal for an ambush.","tagline":"A cold-blooded thriller!","cast":[{"n":"Frank Sinatra","c":"John Baron","p":"/dafKPsivu50RdChBSrgGmMRenYt.jpg","q":"Q40912"},{"n":"Sterling Hayden","c":"Sheriff Tod Shaw","p":"/dCTe6BsGSp9QTcva2Pz4wbxxYMY.jpg","q":"Q323166"},{"n":"James Gleason","c":"Peter 'Pop' Benson","p":"/nIWAiRVuVbEfD8iSWymhOSJlWUm.jpg","q":"Q726398"},{"n":"Nancy Gates","c":"Ellen Benson","p":"/3jOEc0j4THNk9RCzKdCzSxEz8Zd.jpg","q":"Q2025814"},{"n":"Kim Charney","c":"Peter 'Pidge' Benson III","p":"/pUEgV6K4vRoQOu1VXUPgaXLQURG.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Willis Bouchey","c":"Secret Service Detail Chief Dan Carney","p":"/x7cecmICRE4EfOTblb1Nd3TrMWT.jpg","q":"Q2581539"},{"n":"Paul Frees","c":"Benny Conklin","p":"/pACT0LYkEyff7PGt88iqr5u9T7u.jpg","q":"Q3090544"},{"n":"Christopher Dark","c":"Bart Wheeler","p":"/6gcTasp92oHGwSahsBwAcpn7OWa.jpg","q":null},{"n":"James O'Hara","c":"Jud Hobson","p":"/9TVlLzmVdbNMqDmMUZJecDXn7vU.jpg","q":"Q21469237"},{"n":"Kem Dibbs","c":"Wilson","p":null,"q":null}],"country":["United States"],"language":["English"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Suddenly_%281954_film%29","qid":"Q1041834"}